# Place two PNG icons in this folder before packaging the Teams app:
#
#   color.png    - 192x192, full-color brand mark
#   outline.png  - 32x32,  transparent, white outline only
#
# These are referenced by appPackage/manifest.json and are required by
# Teams when sideloading or submitting the app. The Microsoft 365 Agents
# Toolkit can generate placeholders for you ("Teams: Add icons" command).
